            <ArticleTitle>Surgical management of recalcitrant heel pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>187-95</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A minimal incision approach to the treatment of heel spur syndrome has been presented. This procedure is indicated when the surgeon thinks that conservative modalities have failed to alleviate heel pain. Knowledge of anatomic structures is imperative.</AbstractText>
